# 入库存 LF，Windows 检出也是 LF：避免「LF → CRLF」这类整份文件的假 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf

# 二进制：课件与 PDF 交给 Git 原样存，不做换行/文本比较。
*.pptx binary
*.ppt binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
